   "size": "m",
   "text": "Option B\n\n• Full-screen poster at the top with Preview / Details buttons.\n• Top 10 row with big numbers, Continue watching with progress bars.\n• Deep blue-black background, bold condensed titles.\n• Flat bottom bar, same 5 tabs.\n• Channels shown as picture tiles."
