   "text": "Option C\n\n• Explore: sharp poster grid with crown badges for premium.\n• Channels work like a chat app: list with unread counts, channel page shows posts as message bubbles with views, JOIN bar at the bottom.\n• Pure black background, bold rounded text, square orange buttons."
